&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience in M&amp;amp;A, investment analysis, corporate finance, consulting, financial&amp;nbsp;modelling&amp;nbsp;or business analysis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
